  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Trong hình chữ nhật <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> thuộc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/273a041a1a9b5adba707215a1e503c0a093292a75a461a916f12d8860792875f.svg\" alt=\"Hìn